  "details": "- CVE-2026-42946: fix buffer over-read and excessive memory allocation in\n  ngx_http_scgi_module and ngx_http_uwsgi_module when an upstream server\n  returns an unrecognized status line; reset r->state before falling back to\n  header parsing so the header parser no longer resumes from a status-line\n  state and reads through an uninitialized r->header_name_start, and reuse\n  r->header_name_start to backtrack the buffer position for status lines\n  split across reads",
